{"product":{"id":5138937675821,"title":"Truck Cargo Bar with 2.5\" x 4\" No-Slip Pads | 4 Pack","body_html":"\u003ch2\u003eAdjustable Load Bars for Trucks \/ Enclosed Trailers\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCargo bars feature 2.5\" x 4\" bolt-on padded feet for no-slip traction once they are extended to appropriate pressure. Also known as trailer load locks, these adjustable round steel tube load bars are made of high-quality steel and adjust from 89\" to 103.94\".\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThey are a great solution for sectioning out space in your trailer, and the tension mechanism lets you ensure a secure hold. They help hold cargo in place, preventing shifting that can lead to damage or other issues.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e4-Pack Truck Cargo Bar Features\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCorrosion-Resistant:\u003c\/strong\u003e Steel body has a galvanized coating to prevent rust.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFast Tensioning: \u003c\/strong\u003eThe handle simply locks into place, pushing the ends out to create the tension needed for secure placement.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eNo-Slip Traction: \u003c\/strong\u003eThe padded feet are designed to prevent the cargo bar from shifting once it's locked into place. \u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy to Store: \u003c\/strong\u003eKeep these load lock bars out of the way when not in use with a \u003ca href=\"\/products\/cargo-bar-holder-holds-2-cargo-bars\"\u003ecargo bar holder\u003c\/a\u003e.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eReplacement Parts Available: \u003c\/strong\u003eIf your \u003ca href=\"\/products\/Cargo-Bar-Feet-2-x-4-pads-2-Pack\"\u003ecargo bar feet\u003c\/a\u003e or \u003ca href=\"\/products\/ratchet-body-for-cargo-bar\"\u003etension lock handle\u003c\/a\u003e break, save money by just purchasing replacement parts!\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eCan This Adjustable Cargo Bar Be Shortened?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf this cargo bar is too wide for your delivery van or other smaller vehicle, it's easy to shorten! The end without the tension lock can be removed and cut down to the right size - all you'll need are a couple of wrenches, a drill, and a hacksaw.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eComprehensive Cargo Securement Options\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf these adjustable load bars won't work for your application, check our full line of cargo securement, including \u003ca href=\"\/products\/92-Aluminum-Shoring-Beam-Extends-to-103\"\u003ealuminum shoring beams\u003c\/a\u003e, \u003ca href=\"\/products\/92-Steel-Shoring-Beam-Extends-to-103-NEW-LOW-PRICE\"\u003esteel shoring beams\u003c\/a\u003e, \u003ca href=\"\/products\/Wood-End-Socket-for-E-Track\"\u003ewood end sockets\u003c\/a\u003e, and \u003ca href=\"\/collections\/Cargo-Straps-E-Track\"\u003eE-track ratchet \u0026amp; cam straps\u003c\/a\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you have any questions, call or chat to speak to one of our product experts.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"\/pages\/product-safety-warnings#shoring_beams\"\u003eView Product Safety Warnings\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eCalifornia Residents: \u003ca style=\"color: black;\" data-target=\"#myModal\" data-toggle=\"modal\"\u003eWARNING\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"US Cargo Control","product_type":"Load Bars \u0026 Load Locks","created_at":"2020-07-20T21:05:38-05:00","handle":"round-tube-cargo-load-bars-w-2x4-pads-4-pack","updated_at":"2026-11-13T15:53:44-06:00","published_at":"2025-03-25T23:21:13-05:00","template_suffix":"","published_scope":"web","tags":"Cargo Load Bars, CAT:Interior Van Bars, CBX GLOBAL, Garden Truck Stop, Gear Head GWP Eligible, Genuine Parts Company, Load Bars \u0026 Cargo Bars, Nor-Am Cold Storage, QUEEN:LB200-4PK, Resilient Energy \u0026 Infrastructure, RUAN, Source: USCC, SUBCAT:Load Bars, Sysco, X Track Accessories","variants":[{"id":34697679700013,"product_id":5138937675821,"title":"Default Title","price":"147.99","sku":"LB200-4PK","position":1,"compare_at_price":"155.96","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2020-07-20T21:05:39-05:00","updated_at":"2026-11-13T15:53:44-06:00","taxable":true,"barcode":"840086906298","grams":20865,"image_id":null,"weight":46.0,"weight_unit":"lb","tax_code":"","requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"USD","compare_at_price_currency":"USD","quantity_price_breaks":[]}],"options":[{"id":6626993012781,"product_id":5138937675821,"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}],"images":[{"id":34275199123501,"product_id":5138937675821,"position":1,"created_at":"2024-11-25T13:45:24-06:00","updated_at":"2024-11-27T09:51:12-06:00","alt":null,"width":1600,"height":1600,"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0283\/2229\/9949\/files\/truck-cargo-bar-with-non-slip-pads-4-pack.01.jpg?v=1732722672","variant_ids":[]},{"id":34275198926893,"product_id":5138937675821,"position":2,"created_at":"2024-11-25T13:45:24-06:00","updated_at":"2025-10-20T09:52:00-05:00","alt":null,"width":1500,"height":1500,"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0283\/2229\/9949\/files\/truck-cargo-bar-with-non-slip-pads-4-pack.02.jpg?v=1760971920","variant_ids":[]},{"id":34275198894125,"product_id":5138937675821,"position":3,"created_at":"2024-11-25T13:45:24-06:00","updated_at":"2024-11-25T13:45:26-06:00","alt":null,"width":1500,"height":1500,"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0283\/2229\/9949\/files\/truck-cargo-bar-with-non-slip-pads-4-pack.03.jpg?v=1732563926","variant_ids":[]},{"id":34275199057965,"product_id":5138937675821,"position":4,"created_at":"2024-11-25T13:45:24-06:00","updated_at":"2024-11-25T13:45:26-06:00","alt":null,"width":1600,"height":1600,"src":"https:\/\/cdn.s